  "Posted 'Jabba's PalaceAudience Chamber' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark).",
  "Posted 'ECC Iggy' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'ECC 4-Lom' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'EJP Dengar' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'EPP Fett' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'EPP Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'DLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith.",
  "Posted 'Prince Xixor' dested Prince Xizor; 'Dr.E&Ponda Paba' dested Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba; 'Omini Box/It's Worse' dested Ommni Box & It's Worse; 'Weapon Lev.' dested the Dark Weapon Levitation (Cloud City).",
  "Posted 'Iggy in Ship', 'Zuckuss in Ship' and 'Bossk in Ship' dested IG-88 In IG-2000, Zuckuss In Mist Hunter and Bossk In Hound's Tooth.",
